      <div>Кому: <a class="moz-txt-link-abbreviated" href="mailto:khatashkeeva@yandex.ru">khatashkeeva@yandex.ru</a> (<a class="moz-txt-link-abbreviated" href="mailto:khatashkeeva@yandex.ru">khatashkeeva@yandex.ru</a>);</div>
